near`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n##\n[0.12.13](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-linear-v0.12.12...onetaskgraph-linear-v0.12.13)\n- 2026-10-30\n\n### Added\n\n- project human tasks through existing tracker routing\n([#3824](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3824))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-core`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n##\n[0.12.13](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-core-v0.12.12...onetaskgraph-core-v0.12.13)\n- 2026-10-30\n\n### Added\n\n- project human tasks through existing tracker routing\n([#3824](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3824))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n##\n[0.12.13](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/v0.12.12...v0.12.13)\n- 2026-10-30\n\n### Added\n\n- project human tasks through existing tracker routing\n([#3824](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3824))\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with\n[release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","timestamp":"2026-10-30T08:28:10Z","author":{"name":"Nick DeRobertis","email":"whoopnip@gmail.com"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com"}},"repository":{"id":1343250630,"node_id":"R_kgDOUBBgxg","name":"onetaskgraph","full_name":"nickderobertis/onetaskgraph","private":false,"owner":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/us